Bring 2 cups water and @Veggie Stock Concentrate{1} to a gentle simmer in a small #pot{} over low heat. Wash and dry all produce. Mince or grate @Garlic{2%clove}. Halve, peel, and mince @Shallot{1}. Pour @Whole Peeled Tomatoes{14%ounce} and their juices into a medium #bowl{}; using your hands, crush tomatoes into small pieces. Zest and quarter @Lemon{1}.

Heat a large drizzle of @Olive Oil{2%tablespoon} In a large #pan{} over medium heat. Add garlic. Set aside @Shallot{1%tsp}; add the rest to pan. Cook until fragrant, about ~{2%minutes}. Stir in @Arborio Rice{¾%cup}, @Dried Oregano{1%teaspoon}, a pinch of @Salt{}, and @Chili Flakes{¼%tsp} (add up to ¼ tsp more if you like spicy food). Stir until rice is translucent, about ~{30%seconds}.

Add stock, ½ cup at a time, to pan with rice, stirring after each addition. Allow rice to absorb most of stock before adding more. Repeat process until rice is just al dente, ~{20-25%minutes}. Add crushed tomatoes, @Sugar{½%tsp}, and @Salt{½%tsp}. Increase heat to medium high and cook until creamy, ~{5-7%minutes}. Turn off heat.

Once risotto has simmered for 10 minutes, heat a large drizzle of olive oil in a medium #pan{} over medium-high heat (use a nonstick #pan{} if you have one). Add @Crab Cakes{10%ounce} and cook until browned and crispy, ~{4-6%minutes} per side. Turn off heat.

In a second medium bowl, whisk together the juice from 2 lemon wedges, a large drizzle of olive oil, reserved shallot, @Sugar{¼%tsp}, and a pinch of salt and @Pepper{}. Toss in @Mixed Greens{2%ounce} until thoroughly coated. Place @Butter{2%TBSP} in a small #microwave-safe bowl{}. Microwave on high until just softened, about ~{10%seconds} (if melted, start over). Stir in half the lemon zest, a pinch of remaining @Chili Flakes{1%teaspoon}, and salt.

Stir @Parmesan Cheese{¼%cup} and @Butter{1%TBSP} into pan with risotto; season with salt and pepper. Divide between #bowls{}. Top with crab cakes and lemon chili @Butter{3%tablespoon}. Sprinkle with remaining lemon zest if desired. Serve with salad and remaining lemon wedges on the side.
